1
00:00:01,654 --> 00:00:04,447
Toei Company, Ltd. Presents

2
00:00:11,826 --> 00:00:15,826
SATOMI HAKKENDEN
(Sorcerer's Orb, Part III)

3
00:00:33,654 --> 00:00:42,757
**

4
00:00:43,757 --> 00:00:44,895
CAST

5
00:01:18,379 --> 00:01:22,240
The duel that unfolded
between Inukai Genpachi

6
00:01:22,240 --> 00:01:25,757
and Inuzuka Shino at
Koga Palace, over the

7
00:01:25,757 --> 00:01:29,205
infamous Murasamemaru
sword, caused the both

8
00:01:29,206 --> 00:01:30,827
of them to fall in the
rapids down below.

9
00:01:31,792 --> 00:01:34,757
But with Heaven's help,
they landed in a small

10
00:01:34,757 --> 00:01:37,792
boat, had drifted to a
bay in Ryotoku, and

11
00:01:37,792 --> 00:01:39,619
were saved by Bungobei.

12
00:01:41,275 --> 00:01:44,413
Kobungo, who is the son
of Bungobei, was known

13
00:01:44,413 --> 00:01:47,757
for his gentleness, and
he sadly dies by the hands

14
00:01:47,757 --> 00:01:51,343
of Boss Sanrin (Fusahachi)
to protect Shino.

15
00:01:53,413 --> 00:01:57,137
Fusahachi's son, Daihachi,
turns out to be one of the

16
00:01:57,137 --> 00:01:59,827
sorcerers that is tied by
the fate of the eight beads.

17
00:02:02,172 --> 00:02:08,172
Meanwhile, Gakuzo is framed
by the evil governor for murder

18
00:02:08,172 --> 00:02:11,723
and undergoes torture everyday,

19
00:02:13,516 --> 00:02:18,033
And Hamaji, who is
separated from her lover,

20
00:02:18,034 --> 00:02:19,896
Shino, lives in hiding
at a farmer's house.

21
00:02:21,551 --> 00:02:26,171
Ronin Aboshi Samojiro,
who plots to kill Shino

22
00:02:26,172 --> 00:02:29,103
and make Hamaji his,
conspires with the governor

23
00:02:29,103 --> 00:02:32,343
to lure both Shino
and Hamaji out,

24
00:02:32,343 --> 00:02:36,619
by mercilessly executing
Gakuzo for the false charges.

25
00:02:38,377 --> 00:02:42,757
Hamaji forgets about the
danger she is in and rushes

26
00:02:42,757 --> 00:02:45,412
over to the execution grounds
and falls victim to Samojiro.

27
00:02:46,377 --> 00:02:50,860
To add to it, Shino,
Genpachi and Kobungo

28
00:02:50,860 --> 00:02:54,412
storm onto the grounds
to save Gakuzo, where

29
00:02:54,413 --> 00:02:57,585
the rifle squad and
officers await them.

30
00:03:00,654 --> 00:03:06,481
Will there be a day when the
eight beads will come together?

31
00:03:08,343 --> 00:03:12,757
What will the outcome at
the execution grounds be?

32
00:03:20,964 --> 00:03:21,930
Fire!

33
00:03:33,620 --> 00:03:35,102
They are sorcerers!

34
00:03:35,860 --> 00:03:36,860
Be on your guard!

35
00:03:54,551 --> 00:03:55,413
We've got help!

36
00:03:55,930 --> 00:03:56,998
Shino, go after Kyuroku.

37
00:03:56,998 --> 00:03:57,895
We'll save Sosuke.

38
00:04:29,551 --> 00:04:31,378
Kyuroku, you are my
uncle and aunt's enemy!

39
00:04:31,792 --> 00:04:32,654
Fight me fair and square!

40
00:04:35,137 --> 00:04:36,551
It wasn't supposed
to turn out like this.

41
00:04:37,275 --> 00:04:38,896
That damn Samojiro!

42
00:04:54,792 --> 00:04:55,654
Serves you right!

43
00:05:10,999 --> 00:05:13,136
Hamaji, give up already.

44
00:05:38,999 --> 00:05:39,964
Damn you!

45
00:05:41,310 --> 00:05:43,758
Stop it. You're being unsightly.

46
00:06:19,068 --> 00:06:20,758
Putting Hamaji aside...

47
00:06:21,620 --> 00:06:23,206
Sosuke, I'm glad you're safe.

48
00:06:25,206 --> 00:06:27,516
You shouldn't sound
so unconcerned about her.

49
00:06:29,551 --> 00:06:31,171
So this ball has that
kind of great power.

50
00:06:32,034 --> 00:06:35,206
I'll put this in my mouth,
if I should ever get tortured.

51
00:06:35,930 --> 00:06:37,205
It's truly strange indeed.

52
00:06:37,895 --> 00:06:39,240
I didn't feel any pain at all.

53
00:06:40,930 --> 00:06:43,550
It's too bad about
Inuyama Dosetsu.

54
00:06:44,516 --> 00:06:46,482
Had we known, we would
have called on him.

55
00:06:47,206 --> 00:06:49,103
He's a problem because
he quickly disappears.

56
00:06:52,585 --> 00:06:53,551
What did you find out?

57
00:06:54,310 --> 00:06:55,758
No one has seen her around.

58
00:06:59,964 --> 00:07:01,136
The poor girl...

59
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:05,999
She was so worried about you.

60
00:07:07,930 --> 00:07:09,240
It can't be helped now.

61
00:07:09,999 --> 00:07:11,619
If there's fate, we should
meet up somewhere.

62
00:07:12,310 --> 00:07:13,896
We can't be hanging
around here too long.

63
00:07:14,413 --> 00:07:15,309
Why don't you stay back?

64
00:07:15,792 --> 00:07:16,550
I can't do that.

65
00:07:17,344 --> 00:07:19,137
I'll leave Hamaji to Yasuhei.

66
00:07:20,551 --> 00:07:23,137
We must find the other
two as soon as possible

67
00:07:23,137 --> 00:07:24,172
and meet with Dosetsu

68
00:07:33,103 --> 00:07:34,068
Let's go our separate ways.

69
00:07:35,206 --> 00:07:37,413
Let's meet at Yasuhei's
place exactly a year from today.

70
00:07:38,137 --> 00:07:39,896
hope all eight of us
will be together next year.

71
00:07:40,585 --> 00:07:41,585
Yes, I hope so, too.

72
00:07:42,344 --> 00:07:42,896
See you

73
00:07:43,240 --> 00:07:43,861
Be careful.

74
00:07:44,585 --> 00:07:45,275
Take care.

75
00:08:53,826 --> 00:08:54,585
Sosuke!

76
00:08:55,344 --> 00:08:56,206
Shino!

77
00:08:56,964 --> 00:08:57,860
Any luck?

78
00:08:57,860 --> 00:08:58,585
No.

79
00:08:59,447 --> 00:09:00,688
Twonder how the
others are doing.

80
00:09:23,722 --> 00:09:25,343
Thank you.

81
00:09:27,068 --> 00:09:28,171
Please be careful.

82
00:09:31,344 --> 00:09:33,068
Welcome. You must be tired.

83
00:09:41,481 --> 00:09:43,654
What are the bows
and rifles for?

84
00:09:44,344 --> 00:09:45,551
Sir, haven't you heard?

85
00:09:46,895 --> 00:09:49,412
Mt. Kojin up ahead
is very dangerous

86
00:09:50,792 --> 00:09:52,309
Bandits and specters appear.

87
00:09:53,172 --> 00:09:58,103
Even the strong samurai take
those weapons up to be safe.

88
00:09:59,102 --> 00:10:00,516
That's truly amusing!

89
00:10:01,137 --> 00:10:02,654
I'd love to meet up
with a bandit or specter!

90
00:10:03,447 --> 00:10:05,102
Sir, it's no laughing matter.

91
00:10:05,999 --> 00:10:08,999
If you get lost and
wander into the sanctuary...

92
00:10:08,999 --> 00:10:10,240
You could lose your life.

93
00:10:11,034 --> 00:10:12,275
What kind of place is it?

94
00:10:13,275 --> 00:10:15,482
No one has ever returned
alive, so we don't know

95
00:10:16,447 --> 00:10:18,930
Except for a man
named Akaiwa.

96
00:10:19,826 --> 00:10:23,240
But even he went crazy,
as if he were possessed.

97
00:10:23,964 --> 00:10:25,585
What do you mean?

98
00:10:26,654 --> 00:10:29,619
I have a sad story to tell you.

99
00:10:30,930 --> 00:10:35,205
There used to be a fine
samurai named Akaiwa Ikkaku

100
00:10:35,206 --> 00:10:37,482
living in Akaiwa Village,
right up this road.

101
00:10:39,826 --> 00:10:43,171
This happened about
17 or 18 years ago.

102
00:10:47,999 --> 00:10:51,792
Mt. Kojin is known to be
a sacred mountain.

103
00:10:52,620 --> 00:10:55,344
But no one's been to the
sanctuary for a long time.

104
00:10:57,137 --> 00:11:00,068
Recently, there have been
rumors that specters live there.

105
00:11:00,999 --> 00:11:04,447
It upsets me to have the
specters go rampage there.

106
00:11:06,344 --> 00:11:09,758
I'm thinking of going up
tomorrow to verify the truth.

107
00:11:11,620 --> 00:11:13,275
Sensei, I wouldn't
advise that.

108
00:11:14,172 --> 00:11:15,689
"Discretion is the
better part of valor."

109
00:11:16,481 --> 00:11:19,481
Don't be silly What are
we training hard for?

110
00:11:21,792 --> 00:11:24,895
What good is it if we can't
save the distressed people?

111
00:11:26,860 --> 00:11:28,792
If we don't make use of it,
we'll be wasting it.

112
00:11:41,413 --> 00:11:42,999
Sensei, it's dangerous
to go any further

113
00:11:44,481 --> 00:11:46,619
If you're scared,
you can turn back.

114
00:11:47,275 --> 00:11:48,275
Sensei, let us proceed on.

115
00:12:36,172 --> 00:12:38,447
Sensei!, Beyond this
is the sanctuary.

116
00:12:39,344 --> 00:12:40,206
Let us go back.

117
00:12:40,930 --> 00:12:42,412
If you're scared, leave.

118
00:12:44,688 --> 00:12:46,516
I'll go alone from
this point on

119
00:13:04,654 --> 00:13:06,481
He made it back home, but...

120
00:13:07,964 --> 00:13:09,723
The curse on him
was frightening.

121
00:13:10,722 --> 00:13:12,964
He had turned into a
completely different man.

122
00:13:15,481 --> 00:13:19,999
After his second wife,
Madoi, bore him a child,

123
00:13:19,999 --> 00:13:23,619
he started picking on his
first wife's son, Kakutaro,

124
00:13:25,654 --> 00:13:28,240
Kakutaro is such
a filial and good son.

125
00:13:29,688 --> 00:13:32,964
If you hate him so much,
please give him to me.

126
00:13:32,964 --> 00:13:36,102
He is the son of my
dear younger sister.

127
00:13:37,379 --> 00:13:38,551
Suit yourself.

128
00:13:39,999 --> 00:13:40,930
see.

129
00:13:42,551 --> 00:13:45,757
Kakutaro, you are
my son from today.

130
00:13:46,757 --> 00:13:49,274
So your name will be
Inumura Kakutaro.

131
00:13:54,516 --> 00:13:59,964
Inumura Norikiyo, the
first wife's older brother

132
00:13:59,964 --> 00:14:02,136
felt so sorry for him that
he adopted him as his son.

133
00:14:02,999 --> 00:14:05,722
Two years ago, he had
him wed his daughter,

134
00:14:05,722 --> 00:14:07,240
and take over the family name.

135
00:14:08,620 --> 00:14:13,102
Then Norikiyo and his wife
died shortly thereafter.

136
00:14:14,585 --> 00:14:16,240
There's nothing sad about it.

137
00:14:17,551 --> 00:14:19,137
The story doesn't end here.

138
00:14:20,310 --> 00:14:23,172
In the Akaiwa family, the
second wife, Madoi, died.

139
00:14:24,034 --> 00:14:26,620
And every wife after that
didn't live very long.

140
00:14:27,964 --> 00:14:31,102
His latest wife, Funamushi,
seems to get along with him.

141
00:14:32,722 --> 00:14:37,722
She took Kakutaro and his
wife in, to get their fortune.

142
00:14:38,447 --> 00:14:39,723
Inumura, huh...

143
00:14:41,551 --> 00:14:42,413
Wait a minute.

144
00:14:43,310 --> 00:14:45,034
Yes, their family name
is Inumura.

145
00:14:46,034 --> 00:14:49,620
When Hinaginu
became pregnant,

146
00:14:49,620 --> 00:14:53,516
Funamushi accused
her of adultery,

147
00:14:53,516 --> 00:14:55,240
and had Kakutaro divorce her

148
00:14:56,034 --> 00:14:58,654
Then shortly after that,
she disowned KakutaroWhat is Inumura

149
00:14:59,654 --> 00:15:01,826
Kakutaro doing now?

150
00:15:02,930 --> 00:15:05,412
He's a filial son as usual.

151
00:15:06,930 --> 00:15:12,136
He has a hermitage up ahead,
where he trains as a priest.

152
00:15:13,275 --> 00:15:16,516
He shows no sign of
resentment towards his father

153
00:15:20,310 --> 00:15:23,827
We must've been talking
long. It's starting to get dark.

154
00:15:24,999 --> 00:15:27,585
It might get dangerous
along the dark roads.

155
00:15:28,240 --> 00:15:29,275
You needn't worry about me.

156
00:15:29,860 --> 00:15:31,447
I'll take your advice
and buy a bow.

157
00:15:32,379 --> 00:15:33,551
That's a good idea.

158
00:15:39,379 --> 00:15:41,482
It's better to be safe than sorry.

159
00:15:45,481 --> 00:15:46,654
Be careful

160
00:16:25,172 --> 00:16:26,378
I must've taken the wrong road.

161
00:20:12,068 --> 00:20:14,240
Specter! So you've
showed up again!

162
00:20:15,688 --> 00:20:18,481
I'm not what you think.

163
00:20:20,137 --> 00:20:22,965
I'm not a specter.

164
00:20:25,034 --> 00:20:28,965
I'm Akaiwa Ikkaku's ghost.

165
00:20:30,757 --> 00:20:31,964
But he's alive.

166
00:20:33,172 --> 00:20:34,861
Don't lie to me because
I don't know his face!

167
00:20:36,068 --> 00:20:38,240
Please listen to my story.

168
00:20:39,274 --> 00:20:42,791
I've been waiting
for you to come.

169
00:20:44,240 --> 00:20:47,930
If possible, please
grant me my wish.

170
00:20:49,137 --> 00:20:50,068
This is strange indeed.

171
00:20:51,447 --> 00:20:52,481
I'll hear you out.

172
00:20:54,068 --> 00:20:59,999
You must've heard the
general story at the tea stand.

173
00:21:02,654 --> 00:21:06,102
I defied all warnings
and came up here.

174
00:21:07,826 --> 00:21:10,895
I was carelessly
killed by a wildcat.

175
00:21:11,861 --> 00:21:16,309
That goblin cat had his
heart set on my wife, Madoi.

176
00:21:17,757 --> 00:21:22,550
So he assumed my identity
and went down to the village.

177
00:21:23,551 --> 00:21:25,585
Is the present Akaiwa
Ikkaku a goblin cat?

178
00:21:26,413 --> 00:21:27,275
That's right.

179
00:21:28,964 --> 00:21:32,999
What you shot the arrow
at earlier, is a goblin.

180
00:21:34,206 --> 00:21:39,034
The child that Madoi bore
is a goblin cat's child.

181
00:21:40,619 --> 00:21:47,275
Please assist Kakutaro
in getting revenge for me.

182
00:21:49,172 --> 00:21:52,930
Why didn't the goblin
cat kill Kakutaro?

183
00:21:54,654 --> 00:21:59,619
Because he has a
mysterious ball like you.

184
00:22:01,068 --> 00:22:05,240
The character "rei"
is written on his ball.

185
00:22:08,309 --> 00:22:10,274
Which means, you are
like a parent to me.

186
00:22:11,240 --> 00:22:12,758
I'll surely avenge you!

187
00:22:39,274 --> 00:22:41,757
Excuse me!

188
00:23:08,722 --> 00:23:12,033
Excuse me. I am a ronin
called Inukai Genpachi.

189
00:23:12,688 --> 00:23:13,860
I would like to talk to you.

190
00:23:46,240 --> 00:23:48,275
Dear! Please open this door.

191
00:23:52,274 --> 00:23:55,998
Please open this door!

192
00:24:14,654 --> 00:24:20,240
Dear! Do you refuse
to talk to me?

193
00:24:22,999 --> 00:24:24,516
This is too cruel!

194
00:24:26,999 --> 00:24:30,033
If you don't talk to me today...

195
00:24:31,447 --> 00:24:33,102
I will not go on living.

196
00:24:34,413 --> 00:24:35,550
Dear!

197
00:24:53,930 --> 00:24:57,516
If you won't forgive me
after all my pleadings...

198
00:24:58,377 --> 00:25:00,033
There's nothing more I can do.

199
00:25:01,516 --> 00:25:03,344
I rather not live in suffering.

200
00:25:04,999 --> 00:25:07,102
I shall be waiting for
you in the other world.

201
00:25:32,757 --> 00:25:34,205
Sir Inukai, please wait.

202
00:25:38,792 --> 00:25:40,654
I was in the middle
of my meditation.

203
00:25:41,274 --> 00:25:42,343
But I'm done now.

204
00:25:43,103 --> 00:25:43,896
Please come in.

205
00:25:45,068 --> 00:25:48,689
Please forgive me.
I didn't know that.

206
00:25:49,654 --> 00:25:50,516
Please come in.

207
00:26:03,274 --> 00:26:05,240
I'll get straight to the point.

208
00:26:06,413 --> 00:26:07,826
Do you have a ball like this?

209
00:26:09,137 --> 00:26:10,930
Yours should have the
character "rei" on it.

210
00:26:12,757 --> 00:26:14,412
How do you know that?

211
00:26:15,240 --> 00:26:16,482
What is that ball?

212
00:26:17,206 --> 00:26:18,620
I'll tell you the details later.

213
00:26:19,240 --> 00:26:20,896
Please show me your ball first.

214
00:26:21,792 --> 00:26:23,205
I don't have it on me.

215
00:26:24,103 --> 00:26:25,068
Why?

216
00:26:25,930 --> 00:26:29,309
Whenever I got sick as a child,
I would soak the ball in water,

217
00:26:29,309 --> 00:26:30,791
and drink that water.

218
00:26:31,722 --> 00:26:33,929
Then I would strangely
get well.

219
00:26:34,964 --> 00:26:36,895
It probably has that kind
of powers in it.

220
00:26:37,619 --> 00:26:39,137
When my wife got ill recently...

221
00:26:39,792 --> 00:26:41,240
I tried to do the same thing.

222
00:26:41,999 --> 00:26:44,688
But my stepmother walked
in and wanted to see the ball,

223
00:26:44,688 --> 00:26:46,654
so my wife panicked
and swallowed the ball.

224
00:26:47,826 --> 00:26:50,240
Shortly after that,
her stomach got big.

225
00:26:51,688 --> 00:26:54,171
As it happened during the
mourning period of my foster

226
00:26:54,172 --> 00:26:57,103
father, she was accused
of committing adultery.

227
00:27:00,377 --> 00:27:01,550
She's a woman to be pitied.

228
00:27:02,447 --> 00:27:04,516
If you knew she didn't
commit adultery,

229
00:27:04,516 --> 00:27:06,102
why do you ignore her?

230
00:27:06,964 --> 00:27:08,171
She sounded as if she
was going to kill herself.

231
00:28:10,137 --> 00:28:10,999
Stop!

232
00:28:11,447 --> 00:28:12,171
Please let me go.

233
00:28:12,722 --> 00:28:14,929
Hinaginu! Don't be rash.

234
00:28:17,103 --> 00:28:17,930
Mother!

235
00:28:25,103 --> 00:28:28,551
I'm unfilial to my father,
and harsh on my wife.

236
00:28:29,757 --> 00:28:31,964
I can't even fulfill my
duties to my foster father.

237
00:28:33,274 --> 00:28:36,343
That is why I left home
and am living here.

238
00:28:38,172 --> 00:28:39,930
I admire your resolution, but...

239
00:28:41,206 --> 00:28:42,965
You shouldn't sound like
a priest at that young age.

240
00:28:43,930 --> 00:28:45,205
Excuse me!

241
00:28:56,137 --> 00:28:56,999
Mother!

242
00:28:58,172 --> 00:28:59,896
I thought I heard voices.

243
00:29:00,585 --> 00:29:01,999
Do you have a guest over?

244
00:29:02,688 --> 00:29:04,447
No. I was chanting the sutras.

245
00:29:05,413 --> 00:29:06,378
Please come inside.

246
00:29:09,240 --> 00:29:10,034
see.

247
00:29:13,206 --> 00:29:14,999
Hinaginu, come in.

248
00:29:20,172 --> 00:29:22,034
Mother, I divorced her.

249
00:29:22,619 --> 00:29:23,757
Wait a minute.

250
00:29:25,274 --> 00:29:26,446
Hinaginu, come in.

251
00:29:29,377 --> 00:29:34,274
The family has fallen apart
due to some misunderstandings.

252
00:29:35,551 --> 00:29:36,551
Sit down.

253
00:29:38,413 --> 00:29:40,516
I'm thought of as the bad person.

254
00:29:41,447 --> 00:29:42,654
It's truly hard on me.

255
00:29:46,895 --> 00:29:51,585
want to mend
things between you two.

256
00:29:53,826 --> 00:29:56,309
But we don't have
Father's approval on it.

257
00:29:57,034 --> 00:29:59,896
This will help your father, too.

258
00:30:02,034 --> 00:30:06,034
He suffered a serious injury
to his left eye last night.

259
00:30:07,377 --> 00:30:09,550
The doctor said there's
nothing he can do for it.

260
00:30:11,654 --> 00:30:14,240
We can only pray to the
gods and Buddha now.

261
00:30:15,861 --> 00:30:17,998
I was on my way home
from the shrine.

262
00:30:20,413 --> 00:30:22,861
It must be fate that I came
across Hinaginu,

263
00:30:22,861 --> 00:30:24,585
trying to commit suicide.

264
00:30:28,240 --> 00:30:31,447
If I don't do something good,
God won't answer my prayers.

265
00:30:34,309 --> 00:30:37,205
Forgiving Hinaginu will
serve as filial piety.

266
00:30:39,551 --> 00:30:40,964
If you insist on it...

267
00:30:42,516 --> 00:30:43,309
Dear!

268
00:30:52,240 --> 00:30:54,378
Don't let me hold you back.

269
00:30:56,447 --> 00:30:59,792
I'll take my leave before
I'm called inconsiderate.

270
00:31:08,206 --> 00:31:09,275
Dear!

271
00:31:09,757 --> 00:31:10,481
Hinaginu!

272
00:31:59,034 --> 00:32:01,378
Excuse me!

273
00:32:06,137 --> 00:32:07,068
Who are you men?

274
00:32:07,654 --> 00:32:08,619
Samurai in training?

275
00:32:09,240 --> 00:32:10,516
We'd like to receive
some fencing lessons.

276
00:32:11,137 --> 00:32:11,965
Fine!

277
00:32:13,068 --> 00:32:16,896
How bold of you to come
to the infamous Akaiwa Hall!

278
00:32:18,137 --> 00:32:18,758
Come in.

279
00:32:21,551 --> 00:32:22,413
Stop!

280
00:32:30,447 --> 00:32:34,792
We are known for our
rough fencing lessons.

281
00:32:35,688 --> 00:32:38,964
Our fencing is nothing like
the ones you see around.

282
00:32:41,413 --> 00:32:44,309
This should serve as a
good experience for you.

283
00:32:47,722 --> 00:32:48,929
Tsukimura, fight him.

284
00:32:51,481 --> 00:32:52,861
I won't give you any breaks.

285
00:32:53,688 --> 00:32:54,654
Please go easy on me.

286
00:33:20,137 --> 00:33:20,896
I'll fight you!

287
00:33:22,551 --> 00:33:23,585
I'll take you on.

288
00:33:42,274 --> 00:33:43,653
A wooden sword doesn't
show your true skills.

289
00:33:44,377 --> 00:33:46,033
Let's fight with real swords!

290
00:33:48,309 --> 00:33:49,205
Wait!

291
00:33:53,895 --> 00:33:56,378
That was splendid, both of you.

292
00:33:58,516 --> 00:34:03,447
If I was well, I'd fight you.

293
00:34:06,034 --> 00:34:09,275
Actually, maybe I'm
lucky that I'm not well.

294
00:34:12,137 --> 00:34:13,241
Thank you for the lesson.

295
00:34:13,930 --> 00:34:14,861
We'll be taking our leave now.

296
00:34:16,413 --> 00:34:17,654
Please wait.

297
00:34:19,103 --> 00:34:22,999
You must have brave
stories to tell us about.

298
00:34:24,343 --> 00:34:30,481
Will you tell us those
stories over some drinks?

299
00:35:20,137 --> 00:35:22,413
Dear, how do you feel?

300
00:35:23,413 --> 00:35:24,895
The pain is persisting.

301
00:35:27,240 --> 00:35:29,206
It went smoothly
with Kakutaro.

302
00:35:29,895 --> 00:35:31,550
I see.. Thank you.

303
00:35:33,103 --> 00:35:34,965
Father, we're going now.

304
00:35:36,137 --> 00:35:37,965
Have they passed out already?

305
00:35:38,998 --> 00:35:40,102
What's going on?

306
00:35:41,413 --> 00:35:44,068
Two skilled samurai came.

307
00:35:45,034 --> 00:35:47,723
We made them drunk
so that we can kill them.

308
00:35:49,172 --> 00:35:50,654
Do a good job now.

309
00:35:51,378 --> 00:35:52,136
Very well.

310
00:35:54,964 --> 00:35:58,067
Shall we head out now?

311
00:37:02,274 --> 00:37:03,205
They escaped.

312
00:37:09,172 --> 00:37:10,034
How cowardly!

313
00:37:10,757 --> 00:37:11,826
We won't go easy on you!

314
00:37:12,585 --> 00:37:13,964
If you value your life,
leave now.

315
00:37:14,722 --> 00:37:16,102
If you fight us,
you will be killed!

316
00:37:17,964 --> 00:37:19,550
There are only two of them!

317
00:37:20,172 --> 00:37:20,896
Get them!

318
00:38:37,998 --> 00:38:39,757
Dear, get some rest.

319
00:38:40,826 --> 00:38:42,378
I'll wait up a bit more.

320
00:38:43,378 --> 00:38:45,446
In case Sir Inukai returns.

321
00:38:46,826 --> 00:38:49,274
You should go to bed.
You must be tired.

322
00:38:50,034 --> 00:38:51,654
No, I'm fine.

323
00:38:52,757 --> 00:38:55,619
I wonder why Mother became
kind, all of a sudden.

324
00:38:57,274 --> 00:38:59,584
I don't know. It worries me.

325
00:39:01,137 --> 00:39:03,068
In spite of what may happen...

326
00:39:04,206 --> 00:39:08,309
I'm just happy to be
with you like this.

327
00:39:10,481 --> 00:39:12,344
Kakutaro, your father is here.

328
00:39:15,309 --> 00:39:17,446
Both of you, please listen.

329
00:39:18,551 --> 00:39:21,102
Age has a way of getting to you.

330
00:39:21,895 --> 00:39:24,757
My sudden outburst caused

331
00:39:24,757 --> 00:39:28,136
Hinaginu to get divorced and
Kakutaro to be disowned.

332
00:39:29,585 --> 00:39:31,757
I can't help but regret it now.

333
00:39:32,757 --> 00:39:35,722
When I think about how you
both must hate me for it...

334
00:39:35,722 --> 00:39:36,895
It makes me sad.

335
00:39:37,654 --> 00:39:40,033
Father, we do not hate you..

336
00:39:40,860 --> 00:39:44,688
When you treat me so
kindly, I feel embarrassed.

337
00:39:46,240 --> 00:39:50,068
I heard Funamushi
did me a favor recently

338
00:39:50,068 --> 00:39:52,758
and got you two back together.

339
00:39:54,240 --> 00:39:58,447
I came here today to
renew our family bonds,

340
00:39:58,447 --> 00:40:01,378
and make you both happy.

341
00:40:03,481 --> 00:40:07,309
I was so excited about it that
I couldn't wait till morning.

342
00:40:08,964 --> 00:40:10,792
Doesn't that show my love?

343
00:40:15,895 --> 00:40:18,619
I had no idea how you felt...

344
00:40:18,619 --> 00:40:20,033
and was unfilial to you until now.

345
00:40:20,654 --> 00:40:21,964
I can't apologize enough.

346
00:40:23,964 --> 00:40:26,585
Now that you
have forgiven me...

347
00:40:26,585 --> 00:40:28,826
I will do my best
to be filial to you.

348
00:40:30,137 --> 00:40:31,758
Hinaginu, thank him, too.

349
00:40:33,930 --> 00:40:36,757
Thank you very much.

350
00:40:38,585 --> 00:40:41,102
Nothing could have
made me happier.

351
00:40:48,619 --> 00:40:53,137
I'm glad my wish has
been granted.

352
00:40:55,964 --> 00:40:57,619
Dear, aren't you happy, too?

353
00:40:58,137 --> 00:40:58,930
Of course.

354
00:41:00,240 --> 00:41:02,964
was at the depths
of unhappiness,

355
00:41:02,964 --> 00:41:04,274
after severing my ties
with my son.

356
00:41:05,585 --> 00:41:08,102
We are back to being
a family, starting today.

357
00:41:08,585 --> 00:41:09,275
Yes.

358
00:41:11,378 --> 00:41:17,378
When you get old,
you get intolerant.

359
00:41:18,551 --> 00:41:19,861
So I may get unreasonable.

360
00:41:20,895 --> 00:41:24,240
So if you don't like it,
just tell me so.

361
00:41:25,826 --> 00:41:28,723
wouldn't go against
you, Father.

362
00:41:29,516 --> 00:41:31,171
Is that right?

363
00:41:32,757 --> 00:41:33,929
Hinaginu, what about you?

364
00:41:35,413 --> 00:41:36,550
I feel the same way.

365
00:41:39,447 --> 00:41:41,378
Children are great to have.

366
00:41:43,447 --> 00:41:47,309
In that case,
I want your treasure.

367
00:41:48,447 --> 00:41:49,447
Will you give it to me?

368
00:41:50,068 --> 00:41:52,378
We have no treasure.

369
00:41:54,034 --> 00:41:55,171
Isn't that right, Hinaginu?

370
00:41:55,792 --> 00:41:59,102
I want your baby.

371
00:42:01,516 --> 00:42:04,723
Take out the baby
in your womb.

372
00:42:18,172 --> 00:42:22,827
I injured my left eye recently.

373
00:42:23,103 --> 00:42:25,930
When I had a physician
examine it,

374
00:42:25,930 --> 00:42:29,171
he said it can be cured
with the raw liver of an

375
00:42:29,172 --> 00:42:32,861
unborn baby past its fourth
month and its mother's blood.

376
00:42:36,378 --> 00:42:40,895
But it's a medicine that
is very difficult to obtain.

377
00:42:42,930 --> 00:42:44,274
So I had given up on it.

378
00:42:45,551 --> 00:42:49,585
But after hearing your
kind words now,

379
00:42:49,585 --> 00:42:50,964
I am asking you to
give them to me.

380
00:42:53,516 --> 00:42:57,309
Knowing that you will
readily agree to it....

381
00:42:57,309 --> 00:42:59,826
makes my heart ache more.

382
00:43:03,516 --> 00:43:08,516
My heart aches for having
such a fine daughter-in-law.

383
00:43:13,895 --> 00:43:16,274
I would gladly give
my life for you.

384
00:43:18,240 --> 00:43:21,722
But Hinaginu is my wife and the
daughter of my foster parents.

385
00:43:21,722 --> 00:43:24,343
We would be endangering
her life by cutting her up.

386
00:43:24,343 --> 00:43:25,653
If it turns out that she is
sick and not pregnant,

387
00:43:25,654 --> 00:43:27,240
then you won't have your
medicine and she'll die in vain.

388
00:43:27,654 --> 00:43:28,791
How dare you tell me that!

389
00:43:29,516 --> 00:43:33,654
Did you forget your words
that you wouldn't defy me?

390
00:43:34,413 --> 00:43:35,550
No, I haven't forgotten that.

391
00:43:36,240 --> 00:43:37,309
But there's a limit to things.

392
00:43:38,481 --> 00:43:41,481
If you kill your daughter-in-law
and grandchild to cure your eye,

393
00:43:41,481 --> 00:43:43,413
people will see you as heartless.

394
00:43:46,585 --> 00:43:50,826
If you're going to value
your wife over your father,

395
00:43:50,826 --> 00:43:53,343
what can I possibly say?

396
00:43:54,895 --> 00:43:58,964
This serious eye injury
could cost me my life.

397
00:44:02,860 --> 00:44:06,723
How mortifying, when
there's a cure before me.

398
00:44:07,240 --> 00:44:08,896
If I live long, I can
outlive the shame.

399
00:44:10,240 --> 00:44:11,585
Funamushi, how sad it is....

400
00:44:14,413 --> 00:44:18,964
Are you going to sadden
your precious father?

401
00:44:21,826 --> 00:44:24,102
Dear, please kill me.

402
00:44:25,895 --> 00:44:28,343
Even if there should
be no child in me...

403
00:44:28,343 --> 00:44:30,136
At least the suspicions
on me will be cleared.

404
00:44:31,274 --> 00:44:35,102
If I can die as your wife,
will have no regrets.

405
00:44:37,826 --> 00:44:40,171
Hinaginu, that's a fine
resolution.

406
00:44:42,585 --> 00:44:47,068
If I kill my foster parents'
daughter to save my father,

407
00:44:47,068 --> 00:44:48,654
then it'll be immoral.

408
00:44:50,722 --> 00:44:53,412
know. Hinaginu, please
kill yourself with this sword.

409
00:44:54,860 --> 00:44:57,964
Then you'll be praised
for dying for your father.

410
00:45:00,137 --> 00:45:02,792
won't be condemned
for killing you.

411
00:45:05,757 --> 00:45:08,826
And Kakutaro won't be
doing an immoral thing.

412
00:45:16,137 --> 00:45:18,482
That's a brilliant idea.

413
00:45:20,172 --> 00:45:23,274
Hinaginu, being that you
are such a kind person...

414
00:45:23,274 --> 00:45:25,033
No one wants to point
the sword at you.

415
00:45:26,860 --> 00:45:28,481
Use this to kill yourself.

416
00:45:30,137 --> 00:45:33,275
Compose yourself...
and say your prayers.

417
00:45:34,757 --> 00:45:37,136
Father! That's a great idea!

418
00:45:38,826 --> 00:45:41,447
My cowardly brother can't
talk his way out of this one.

419
00:45:43,654 --> 00:45:47,585
How I would love to see
a woman commit suicide.

420
00:45:48,274 --> 00:45:50,378
Watch what you say.

421
00:45:54,516 --> 00:45:56,378
Hinaginu, kill yourself quickly.

422
00:45:57,551 --> 00:45:58,999
Just hurry up with it.

423
00:46:10,619 --> 00:46:11,861
Did you have this all planned?

424
00:46:13,585 --> 00:46:15,826
How dare you kill Father!

425
00:46:32,137 --> 00:46:33,309
came too late.

426
00:46:34,895 --> 00:46:36,240
Why did you interfere?

427
00:46:36,619 --> 00:46:37,551
I'll be condemned for it!

428
00:46:38,068 --> 00:46:40,309
Wait! You don't know
the truth!

429
00:46:40,930 --> 00:46:42,274
This man, lying here,
isn't your father.

430
00:46:42,930 --> 00:46:44,205
This skull is your
real father.

431
00:46:45,585 --> 00:46:47,137
Don't you recognize
this short sword?

432
00:46:52,068 --> 00:46:52,827
Why do you have it?

433
00:46:53,343 --> 00:46:56,102
I met your father's ghost at
the sanctuary at Mt. Kojin.

434
00:47:00,068 --> 00:47:02,034
Who is this man lying here?

435
00:47:02,654 --> 00:47:03,929
The wildcat that
killed your father.

436
00:47:04,619 --> 00:47:05,585
Finish him off.

437
00:47:18,103 --> 00:47:22,275
I can't kill someone
who looks like my father.

438
00:47:24,481 --> 00:47:26,206
His true identity will
show in a day.

439
00:47:27,378 --> 00:47:28,653
I'll wait until then.

440
00:49:32,034 --> 00:49:32,689
Shino!

441
00:49:33,378 --> 00:49:33,895
Genpachi!

442
00:49:55,930 --> 00:49:57,136
Check on Hinaginu.

443
00:50:16,516 --> 00:50:17,309
Dear...

444
00:50:17,757 --> 00:50:18,481
You've come to...

445
00:50:19,447 --> 00:50:21,481
I was in a faraway place...

446
00:50:22,860 --> 00:50:26,343
Then a princess
riding a dog boat...

447
00:50:31,378 --> 00:50:32,343
What's that?

448
00:50:43,447 --> 00:50:45,171
Is it telling us to go
to Ishihama Castle?

449
00:50:45,722 --> 00:50:46,550
That might be it.

450
00:50:46,998 --> 00:50:47,723
Let's go there.

451
00:51:01,895 --> 00:51:02,964
What is there at
Ishihama Castle?

452
00:51:03,654 --> 00:51:06,447
I think we'll find our
other brother with the ball.

453
00:51:07,343 --> 00:51:08,033
I sure hope so.

454
00:51:08,413 --> 00:51:09,137
I'm sure that's it.

455
00:51:09,757 --> 00:51:10,826
I want to meet him already.

456
00:51:20,930 --> 00:51:22,067
That's Inuyama Dosetsu!

457
00:51:23,551 --> 00:51:25,723
Stop!

458
00:51:33,722 --> 00:51:35,205
Let's hurry along
to Ishihama Castle.

459
00:51:50,860 --> 00:51:54,688
The End of Part III

460
00:51:55,172 --> 00:51:56,965
